DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppbbmmttoollnn0033  reads  a  PBM  image as input and produces a DEC LN03+ Sixel
       output file.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In addition to the options common to all programs  based  on  libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common  Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), ppbbmmttoollnn0033 recognizes the
       following command line options:



       --ll nnnn  Use "nn" as value for left margin (default 0).


       --rr nnnn  Use "nn" as value for right margin (default 2400).


       --tt nnnn  Use "nn" as value for top margin (default 0).


       --bb nnnn  Use "nn" as value for bottom margin (default 3400).


       --ff nnnn  Use "nn" as value for form length (default 3400).




